cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite Ritz et al. (2024), the original datasets, and this research software when using these materials."
title: "Gut phageome stability and stress-related immune responses: public-data feasibility and restricted immune reanalysis"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/Qasim-Hussain-Code/phage-immune-stress-axis"
url: "https://github.com/Qasim-Hussain-Code/phage-immune-stress-axis"
authors:
  - family-names: Hussain
    given-names: Qasim
version: 0.2.1
date-released: 2026-10-20
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Public-data feasibility and sample-linkage audit with a restricted exploratory
  immune reanalysis, selected original-method replication, and explicitly
  synthetic statistical software checks. The retrieved inputs do not support a
  measured phageome stability versus immune association. Project authorship is
  Qasim Hussain alone; upstream experimental data retain their original credit
  and licenses.
keywords:
  - bacteriophage
  - virome
  - stress
  - immune phenotype
  - data provenance
  - reproducible research
